WEBVTT

00:03:31.936 --> 00:03:34.976
Until last November,
I was a serving prisoner,

00:03:35.000 --> 00:03:36.499
imprisoned for fraud.

00:03:36.974 --> 00:03:39.574
I was dishonest, and I paid the penalty.

00:03:40.450 --> 00:03:43.675
Before that, I'd been
a practicing solicitor for 30 years.

00:03:44.172 --> 00:03:46.887
I'd had a happy and stable upbringing,

00:03:46.911 --> 00:03:48.109
a good education,

00:03:48.133 --> 00:03:51.077
a happy marriage, which,
I'm pleased to say, continues.

00:03:51.101 --> 00:03:53.648
I have two adult sons.

00:03:54.387 --> 00:03:57.974
When they were growing up,
I did my best to be around for them

00:03:57.998 --> 00:03:59.450
as much as I could.

00:03:59.474 --> 00:04:01.703
And I took a careful interest
in what they did.